  "body": "Tightly held for the last 18 years, this much loved family home offers a resort style paradise in the heart of Manly.\r\n\r\n2 Onepu Lane is an expansive home where character and contemporary style combine effortlessly to create a relaxed lifestyle environment for you and your family to spread out, relax and enjoy!\r\n\r\nSet on 820m² (more or less) of beautifully landscaped grounds and boasting an inground heated swimming pool, spa cabana, double garaging and generous off-street parking options.\r\n\r\nFeatures you will love:\r\nA modern designer kitchen\r\nFisher & Paykel Appliances \r\nIndoor/outdoor flow to inground heated swimming pool/spa and expansive decks\r\n4 double bedrooms\r\n2 bathrooms\r\n2 living areas plus bonus rumpus/office room above garage\r\nDouble Internal Garage\r\n4 off-street parking spaces with room for the boat, tractor or campervan\r\nLandscaped gardens with mature trees offering privacy and room for the trampoline/play equipment\r\nExtensive underhouse storage \r\nWalking distance to Manly Beach, Whangaparaoa Primary School, Whangaparaoa College, Edith Hopper Park, Coast Plaza, Cafes, Restaurants, Library and Cinema.\r\n\r\nThis is a truly special opportunity so phone the owner now to view or for further information. \r\nMake your very own Manly Memories here!",
